{"id":"gradebook","name":"Gradebook","tagline":"Keep track of your grades","blurb":"Gradebook is a simple tool that helps you keep track of your grades.","description":"Gradebook is a simple tool that helps you keep track of your grades. This way you always know how you are doing in your courses.\n\nFeatures:\n\n• Support for numerical and percentage systems\n\n• Assign your grades to categories with different weighting\n\n• Add notes to your grades so that you later know how you could improve\n\n• Your average is calculated automatically taking the weighting of the different categories into account","developer":"Leonhard Kargl","icon":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/io/github/leolost2605.gradebook/f213f420055e02e8d4f576790bccec9b/icons/128x128/io.github.leolost2605.gradebook.png","screenshots":[{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/io/github/leolost2605.gradebook/f213f420055e02e8d4f576790bccec9b/screenshots/image-1_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/io/github/leolost2605.gradebook/f213f420055e02e8d4f576790bccec9b/screenshots/image-1_752x531@1.png","w":1022,"h":722},{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/io/github/leolost2605.gradebook/f213f420055e02e8d4f576790bccec9b/screenshots/image-2_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/io/github/leolost2605.gradebook/f213f420055e02e8d4f576790bccec9b/screenshots/image-2_752x531@1.png","w":1022,"h":722},{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/io/github/leolost2605.gradebook/f213f420055e02e8d4f576790bccec9b/screenshots/image-3_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/io/github/leolost2605.gradebook/f213f420055e02e8d4f576790bccec9b/screenshots/image-3_224x187@1.png","w":622,"h":522},{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/io/github/leolost2605.gradebook/f213f420055e02e8d4f576790bccec9b/screenshots/image-4_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/io/github/leolost2605.gradebook/f213f420055e02e8d4f576790bccec9b/screenshots/image-4_224x242@1.png","w":530,"h":573}],"categories":["Education"],"tags":["educ